### TaskHub requests - works with IntelliJ HTTP client and the VS Code "REST Client" extension.
### Run the login first; the token is captured for the rest (IntelliJ syntax shown, in VS Code copy the token manually).

@host = http://localhost:8080

### Health
GET {{host}}/actuator/health

### Register
POST {{host}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{ "username": "carol", "email": "carol@example.com", "password": "Password1" }

### Login as alice (seeded)
POST {{host}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "username": "alice", "password": "Password1" }

> {% client.global.set("token", response.body.token); %}

### Who am I
GET {{host}}/api/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### My projects (paged, sorted)
GET {{host}}/api/projects?page=0&size=5&sort=name,asc
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Project 1 stats (cached; evicted on task changes)
GET {{host}}/api/projects/1/stats
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Create a project
POST {{host}}/api/projects
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Mobile App", "description": "v2 rewrite" }

### Add bob (id 3) as a member of project 1 (already one in the seed - idempotent)
PUT {{host}}/api/projects/1/members/3
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Create a task (validation: try an empty title or a past due date)
POST {{host}}/api/projects/1/tasks
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "title": "Add dark mode", "priority": "HIGH", "assigneeId": 3, "tags": ["frontend", "ui"] }

### Search tasks: filter + page + sort
GET {{host}}/api/projects/1/tasks?status=IN_PROGRESS&tag=frontend&sort=dueDate,asc
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Overdue tasks
GET {{host}}/api/projects/1/tasks?overdue=true
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Text search
GET {{host}}/api/projects/1/tasks?q=form
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Status change (TODO -> DONE is rejected with 422; TODO -> IN_PROGRESS is fine)
PATCH {{host}}/api/tasks/2/status
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "status": "DONE" }

### Update with optimistic concurrency (send a stale version to get 409)
PUT {{host}}/api/tasks/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "title": "Design new landing page v2", "priority": "CRITICAL", "tags": ["design"], "version": 0 }

### Assign / unassign
PUT {{host}}/api/tasks/1/assignee
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "assigneeId": null }

### Comments
POST {{host}}/api/tasks/1/comments
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "body": "Looks great, shipping this week." }

###
GET {{host}}/api/tasks/1/comments
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Admin-only (alice gets 403; log in as admin to see it work)
GET {{host}}/api/admin/activity
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Admin: list users
GET {{host}}/api/admin/users
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
